                        3
                    </a>
<a class="relative inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 border border-neutral-sage text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary hover:bg-panel-bg rounded-r-md transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">chevron_right</span>
